                         </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <section id=\"about\" class=\"py-16 bg-white\">\n            <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 max-w-5xl text-center\">\n                <h2 class=\"font-['Poppins',sans-serif] font-extrabold text-[#1A202C] relative inline-block after:content-[''] after:absolute after:-bottom-2.5 after:left-1/2 after:-translate-x-1/2 after:w-[60px] after:h-1 after:bg-[#D4AF37] after:rounded-sm text-3xl md:text-5xl mb-8\">Unbreakable Commitment to Cooling Excellence</h2>\n                <div class=\"space-y-6 text-lg text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-justify md:text-center mt-12\">\n                    <p>\n                        IFB air conditioners are engineered for those who demand high-performance cooling and durability. However, the unique atmospheric conditions in Vadodara—high humidity and dust—can take a toll on even the most robust machines. At Atlas Aircon, we offer a specialized, <strong>independent IFB AC service center Vadodara</strong> trusts for technical mastery. We don&#8217;t just fix symptoms; we solve thermodynamic problems at their core.\n                    </p>\n                    <p>\n                        Our engineering squad understands that your time is valuable. Waiting for brand-authorized centers to clear their backlog isn&#8217;t an option when your home is sweltering. We provide rapid response across all major localities, from Alkapuri to Tandalja. Whether you need a simple jet cleaning or a critical <strong>emergency IFB AC repair in Vasna Road Vadodara</strong>, our technicians carry the tools and knowledge to resolve 90% of issues on the first visit.\n                    </p>\n                    <p>\n                        We also recognize the vital role air conditioning plays in our city&#8217;s industrial heartbeat. Our specialized division handles <strong>Panel AC repair Vadodara</strong> for manufacturing units in Makarpura and Nandesari GIDC. We protect your machine’s electronic &#8220;brains&#8221; from overheating, ensuring that your production lines never halt due to a thermal failure. Experience the difference of transparent pricing and engineering integrity with Atlas Aircon.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <section id=\"services\" class=\"py-16 bg-gray-50 rounded-3xl my-12\">\n            <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12\">\n                <div class=\"text-center mb-16\">\n                    <h2 class=\"font-['Poppins',sans-serif] font-extrabold text-[#1A202C] relative inline-block after:content-[''] after:absolute after:-bottom-2.5 after:left-1/2 after:-translate-x-1/2 after:w-[60px] after:h-1 after:bg-[#D4AF37] after:rounded-sm text-3xl md:text-5xl mb-6\">Master-Class Technical Services</h2>\n                    <p class=\"text-xl text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto mt-4\">From domestic inverter split units to heavy industrial electrical panel cooling, we are the authority in thermal management.</p>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-10\">\n                    <article class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-gray-100 shadow-lg group transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-2.5 hover:shadow-[0_20px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\">\n                        <div class=\"relative h-56 overflow-hidden\">\n                            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[#1A202C]/20 group-hover:bg-transparent transition-colors z-10\"></div>\n                            <img decoding=\"async\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transform group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-700\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/ac-repairing-in-vadodara.webp\" alt=\"General IFB AC Repair Vadodara\" onerror=\"handleImageError(this)\" title=\"\">\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-8 flex flex-col h-[calc(100%-14rem)]\">\n                            <div class=\"bg-[#D4AF37]/10 w-14 h-14 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-[#D4AF37] text-2xl mb-6 shadow-sm\"><i class=\"fas fa-tools\"></i></div>\n                            <h3 class=\"text-xl font-['Poppins',sans-serif] font-bold text-[#1A202C] mb-3 mt-0\">Diagnostic &amp; Repair</h3>\n                            <p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-6 line-clamp-3 text-sm\">If your IFB unit is behaving erratically, making loud noises, or failing to cycle properly, we provide a 21-point check-up. We are the leading choice for <strong>IFB split AC repair Vadodara</strong> families trust for identifying gas leaks, compressor issues, and sensor faults with scientific accuracy.</p>\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-t border-gray-100 pt-4 mt-auto\">\n                                <span class=\"text-lg font-bold text-[#D4AF37]\">From ₹399</span>\n                                <a href=\"tel:+919727257141\" class=\"text-[#1A202C] font-semibold hover:text-[#D4AF37] transition-colors flex items-center no-underline\">Call Now <i class=\"fas fa-phone-alt ml-2 text-sm\"></i></a>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </article>\n\n                    <article class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-gray-100 shadow-lg group transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-2.5 hover:shadow-[0_20px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\">\n                        <div class=\"relative h-56 overflow-hidden\">\n                            <img decoding=\"async\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transform group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-700\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/ac-repair-service.webp\" alt=\"Safe IFB AC Installation Vadodara\" onerror=\"handleImageError(this)\" title=\"\">\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-8 flex flex-col h-[calc(100%-14rem)]\">\n                            <div class=\"bg-[#D4AF37]/10 w-14 h-14 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-[#D4AF37] text-2xl mb-6 shadow-sm\"><i class=\"fas fa-level-up-alt\"></i></div>\n                            <h3 class=\"text-xl font-['Poppins',sans-serif] font-bold text-[#1A202C] mb-3 mt-0\">Installation Mastery</h3>\n                            <p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-6 line-clamp-3 text-sm\">Correct mounting is the difference between efficiency and disaster. Our <strong>IFB AC installation Vadodara</strong> team ensures vibration-free mounting, perfect leveling for drainage, and deep-vacuuming of the pipes to ensure your unit delivers the BTU performance promised by the manufacturer.</p>\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-t border-gray-100 pt-4 mt-auto\">\n                                <span class=\"text-lg font-bold text-[#D4AF37]\">From ₹700</span>\n                                <a href=\"tel:+919727257141\" class=\"text-[#1A202C] font-semibold hover:text-[#D4AF37] transition-colors flex items-center no-underline\">Call Now <i class=\"fas fa-phone-alt ml-2 text-sm\"></i></a>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </article>\n\n                    <article class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-gray-100 shadow-lg group transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-2.5 hover:shadow-[0_20px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\">\n                        <div class=\"relative h-56 overflow-hidden bg-[#1A202C] flex items-center justify-center\">\n                            <i class=\"fas fa-industry text-6xl text-[#D4AF37] opacity-80 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-700\"></i>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-8 flex flex-col h-[calc(100%-14rem)]\">\n                            <div class=\"bg-[#D4AF37]/10 w-14 h-14 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-[#D4AF37] text-2xl mb-6 shadow-sm\"><i class=\"fas fa-server\"></i></div>\n                            <h3 class=\"text-xl font-['Poppins',sans-serif] font-bold text-[#1A202C] mb-3 mt-0\">Industrial Panel AC Repair</h3>\n                            <p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-6 line-clamp-3 text-sm\">CNC machine panels and PLC enclosures produce intense internal heat. If your <strong>IFB panel AC</strong> fails, your entire machine is at risk. Our industrial experts provide rapid on-site service in Makarpura GIDC to prevent machinery overheating and costly factory downtime.</p>\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-t border-gray-100 pt-4 mt-auto\">\n                                <span class=\"text-lg font-bold text-[#D4AF37]\">From ₹1500</span>\n                                <a href=\"tel:+919727257141\" class=\"text-[#1A202C] font-semibold hover:text-[#D4AF37] transition-colors flex items-center no-underline\">Call Now <i class=\"fas fa-phone-alt ml-2 text-sm\"></i></a>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </article>\n\n                    <article class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-gray-100 shadow-lg group transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-2.5 hover:shadow-[0_20px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\">\n                        <div class=\"relative h-56 overflow-hidden\">\n                            <img decoding=\"async\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transform group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-700\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/Ac-circuit.webp\" alt=\"Component level IFB AC PCB Repair Vadodara\" onerror=\"handleImageError(this)\" title=\"\">\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-8 flex flex-col h-[calc(100%-14rem)]\">\n                            <div class=\"bg-[#D4AF37]/10 w-14 h-14 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-[#D4AF37] text-2xl mb-6 shadow-sm\"><i class=\"fas fa-microchip\"></i></div>\n                            <h3 class=\"text-xl font-['Poppins',sans-serif] font-bold text-[#1A202C] mb-3 mt-0\">PCB &amp; Circuit Repair</h3>\n                            <p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-6 line-clamp-3 text-sm\">Don’t discard your expensive inverter AC just because of a motherboard fault. Our specialists in <strong>IFB AC PCB repair Vadodara</strong> fix logic boards at the component level, repairing burnt regulators and damaged ICs for a fraction of the cost of a new board.</p>\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-t border-gray-100 pt-4 mt-auto\">\n                                <span class=\"text-lg font-bold text-[#D4AF37]\">From ₹1500</span>\n                                <a href=\"tel:+919727257141\" class=\"text-[#1A202C] font-semibold hover:text-[#D4AF37] transition-colors flex items-center no-underline\">Call Now <i class=\"fas fa-phone-alt ml-2 text-sm\"></i></a>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </article>\n\n                    <article class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-gray-100 shadow-lg group transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-2.5 hover:shadow-[0_20px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\">\n                        <div class=\"relative h-56 overflow-hidden\">\n                            <img decoding=\"async\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transform group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-700\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/AC-compressor-repair-and-replacement-services-in-Vadodara-.webp\" alt=\"IFB AC Compressor Replacement Vadodara\" onerror=\"handleImageError(this)\" title=\"\">\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-8 flex flex-col h-[calc(100%-14rem)]\">\n                            <div class=\"bg-[#D4AF37]/10 w-14 h-14 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-[#D4AF37] text-2xl mb-6 shadow-sm\"><i class=\"fas fa-cogs\"></i></div>\n                            <h3 class=\"text-xl font-['Poppins',sans-serif] font-bold text-[#1A202C] mb-3 mt-0\">Compressor Swapping</h3>\n                            <p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-6 line-clamp-3 text-sm\">When the heart of your machine stops beating, you need professional intervention. We provide honest estimates for the <strong>IFB 1.5 ton AC compressor price Vadodara</strong> customers can rely on. We handle the labor-intensive removal, welding, and system flushing required for a perfect replacement.</p>\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-t border-gray-100 pt-4 mt-auto\">\n                                <span class=\"text-lg font-bold text-[#D4AF37]\">By Quote</span>\n                                <a href=\"tel:+919727257141\" class=\"text-[#1A202C] font-semibold hover:text-[#D4AF37] transition-colors flex items-center no-underline\">Call Now <i class=\"fas fa-phone-alt ml-2 text-sm\"></i></a>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </article>\n\n                    <article class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-gray-100 shadow-lg group transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-2.5 hover:shadow-[0_20px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\">\n                        <div class=\"relative h-56 overflow-hidden\">\n                            <img decoding=\"async\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transform group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-700\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Atlas-aircon-vehicle.webp\" alt=\"Jet Cleaning IFB AC Service Vadodara\" onerror=\"handleImageError(this)\" title=\"\">\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-8 flex flex-col h-[calc(100%-14rem)]\">\n                            <div class=\"bg-[#D4AF37]/10 w-14 h-14 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-[#D4AF37] text-2xl mb-6 shadow-sm\"><i class=\"fas fa-water\"></i></div>\n                            <h3 class=\"text-xl font-['Poppins',sans-serif] font-bold text-[#1A202C] mb-3 mt-0\">Advanced Jet Cleaning</h3>\n                            <p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-6 line-clamp-3 text-sm\">Normal cleaning only touches the mesh. Our <strong>IFB AC deep cleaning Vadodara</strong> utilizes high-pressure water jet pumps to strip away the bacterial slime, mold, and industrial dust trapped deep inside the condenser and evaporator fins, instantly boosting cooling performance.</p>\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-t border-gray-100 pt-4 mt-auto\">\n                                <span class=\"text-lg font-bold text-[#D4AF37]\">From ₹999</span>\n                                <a href=\"tel:+919727257141\" class=\"text-[#1A202C] font-semibold hover:text-[#D4AF37] transition-colors flex items-center no-underline\">Call Now <i class=\"fas fa-phone-alt ml-2 text-sm\"></i></a>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </article>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <section id=\"guide\" class=\"py-16 bg-white relative overflow-hidden\">\n            <div class=\"absolute right-0 top-0 w-1/3 h-full bg-yellow-50/50 skew-x-12 transform origin-top-right z-0\"></div>\n            <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10 max-w-6xl\">\n                <div class=\"text-center mb-16\">\n                    <h2 class=\"font-['Poppins',sans-serif] font-extrabold text-[#1A202C] relative inline-block after:content-[''] after:absolute after:-bottom-2.5 after:left-1/2 after:-translate-x-1/2 after:w-[60px] after:h-1 after:bg-[#D4AF37] after:rounded-sm text-3xl md:text-5xl mb-6\">IFB AC Care: The Pro Guide</h2>\n                    <p class=\"text-xl text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto mt-4\">Understanding the mechanics of your air conditioner can save you thousands of rupees in preventable repairs.</p>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"space-y-12 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed text-lg text-justify md:text-left\">\n                    <div>\n                        <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-['Poppins',sans-serif] font-bold text-[#1A202C] mb-4 flex items-center\"><i class=\"fas fa-hand-holding-water text-blue-500 mr-3\"></i> 1. The Myth of &#8220;Refilling&#8221; Gas</h3>\n                        <p class=\"mb-4\">\n                            One of the biggest misconceptions in the HVAC industry is that air conditioners slowly &#8220;use up&#8221; gas like a car uses petrol. This is categorically false. An AC system is a hermetically sealed loop. If your unit is low on refrigerant, it absolutely means you have a physical breach—a leak—in your copper pipes or coils.\n                        </p>\n                        <p>\n                            Simply &#8220;topping up&#8221; the gas is like pouring water into a leaky bucket. Our protocol for <strong>IFB AC gas filling in Vadodara</strong> is to find the leak using high-pressure nitrogen testing, seal it with high-temperature silver brazing, and then perform a proper evacuation before refilling. This is the only way to ensure your cooling lasts through the entire Gujarat summer.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div>\n                        <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-['Poppins',sans-serif] font-bold text-[#1A202C] mb-4 flex items-center\"><i class=\"fas fa-shield-virus text-green-500 mr-3\"></i> 2. Why Dusty Filters Kill Compressors</h3>\n                        <p class=\"mb-4\">\n                            When clients ask us, &#8220;<strong>why is my IFB AC not cooling?</strong>&#8220;, 60% of the time, the answer is simple dust. Your AC works by absorbing heat from your room&#8217;s air. If the filters are blocked by a thick layer of dust, the machine can&#8217;t pull enough air through the freezing coils. This causes the machine to &#8220;choke,&#8221; leading to the evaporator icing up and the compressor drawing excessive current.\n                        </p>\n                        <p>\n                            A bi-weekly <strong>IFB AC filter cleaning</strong> is the most important maintenance task you can perform. It takes five minutes: pull out the mesh screens, wash them under the tap, dry them, and slide them back. This small habit can prevent the compressor from overheating and save you from a major ₹10,000 replacement bill.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div>\n                        <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-['Poppins',sans-serif] font-bold text-[#1A202C] mb-4 flex items-center\"><i class=\"fas fa-bolt text-red-500 mr-3\"></i> 3. Protecting Your Inverter Logic</h3>\n                        <p class=\"mb-4\">\n                            IFB&#8217;s inverter technology is brilliant for energy efficiency, but it is highly sensitive to voltage fluctuations. The power grid in some parts of Vadodara can be erratic. A sudden spike can fry the regulators on the main PCB board. While we always recommend a heavy-duty stabilizer, it’s not always foolproof.\n                        </p>\n                        <p>\n                            If your AC suddenly goes dead after a power cut, don&#8217;t assume the whole unit is garbage. Our specialists in <strong>IFB inverter AC PCB repair Vadodara</strong> have the diagnostic tools to repair the board rather than replace it. We replace specific relays and capacitors at a fraction of the cost of a new motherboard, keeping your machine running perfectly.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <section class=\"py-16 bg-gray-900 text-white rounded-3xl my-12\">\n            <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 max-w-6xl py-12\">\n                <div class=\"text-center mb-16\">\n                    <h2 class=\"font-['Poppins',sans-serif] font-extrabold text-white relative inline-block after:content-[''] after:absolute after:-bottom-2.5 after:left-1/2 after:-translate-x-1/2 after:w-[60px] after:h-1 after:bg-[#D4AF37] after:rounded-sm text-3xl md:text-5xl mb-6 text-white\">Diagnostic Error Matrix</h2>\n                    <p class=\"text-xl text-gray-400 max-w-3xl mx-auto mt-4\">Is your unit flashing weird numbers? Use this definitive guide to common <strong>IFB AC error codes</strong> to understand the health of your machine.</p>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class=\"bg-gray-800 rounded-2xl shadow-2xl overflow-hidden border border-gray-700\">\n                    <div class=\"overflow-x-auto\">\n                        <table class=\"w-full text-left border-collapse m-0\">\n                            <thead>\n                                <tr class=\"bg-gray-950 text-gray-300 text-sm uppercase tracking-wider\">\n                                    <th class=\"p-6 font-semibold w-1/6\">Display Code</th>\n                                    <th class=\"p-6 font-semibold w-1/3\">What it Means</th>\n                                    <th class=\"p-6 font-semibold w-1/2\">Required Action</th>\n                                </tr>\n                            </thead>\n                            <tbody class=\"divide-y divide-gray-700 text-base\">\n                                <tr class=\"hover:bg-gray-700/50 transition-colors\">\n                                    <td class=\"p-6 font-black text-[#D4AF37] text-xl\">CF</td>\n                                    <td class=\"p-6 font-medium text-gray-300\">Clean Filter Warning</td>\n                                    <td class=\"p-6 text-gray-400\">The unit detects that it cannot pull in enough air. Clean your filters immediately. If the code stays after cleaning, the internal blower fan may be clogged.</td>\n                                </tr>\n                                <tr class=\"hover:bg-gray-700/50 transition-colors bg-gray-800/30\">\n                                    <td class=\"p-6 font-black text-[#D4AF37] text-xl\">E1 / 21</td>\n                                    <td class=\"p-6 font-medium text-gray-300\">Room Sensor Fault</td>\n                                    <td class=\"p-6 text-gray-400\">The thermistor measuring your room temperature has likely failed. A quick <strong>IFB AC sensor repair</strong> is needed to restore functionality.</td>\n                                </tr>\n                                <tr class=\"hover:bg-gray-700/50 transition-colors\">\n                                    <td class=\"p-6 font-black text-[#D4AF37] text-xl\">E5</td>\n                                    <td class=\"p-6 font-medium text-gray-300\">Communication Error</td>\n                                    <td class=\"p-6 text-gray-400\">The inside unit and outside unit have lost their electronic connection. This is usually a wiring issue or a burnt communication IC on the main PCB.</td>\n                                </tr>\n                                <tr class=\"hover:bg-gray-700/50 transition-colors bg-gray-800/30\">\n                                    <td class=\"p-6 font-black text-[#D4AF37] text-xl\">EC</td>\n                                    <td class=\"p-6 font-medium text-gray-300\">Refrigerant Leakage</td>\n                                    <td class=\"p-6 text-gray-400\">The system detects a drop in pressure. Shut the unit off immediately to protect the compressor and call us for leak fixing and gas refilling.</td>\n                                </tr>\n                            </tbody>\n                        </table>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <section id=\"pricing\" class=\"py-16 bg-white\">\n            <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 max-w-5xl\">\n                <div class=\"text-center mb-16\">\n                    <h2 class=\"font-['Poppins',sans-serif] font-extrabold text-[#1A202C] relative inline-block after:content-[''] after:absolute after:-bottom-2.5 after:left-1/2 after:-translate-x-1/2 after:w-[60px] after:h-1 after:bg-[#D4AF37] after:rounded-sm text-3xl md:text-5xl mb-6\">Standardized Service Tariff</h2>\n                    <p class=\"text-xl text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto mt-4\">Transparent pricing is our hallmark. Below is our baseline pricing for <strong>IFB AC service in Vadodara</strong> for the 2026 season.</p>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class=\"bg-gray-50 p-1 md:p-8 rounded-3xl border border-gray-200 shadow-sm\">\n                    <table class=\"w-full text-left border-collapse bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm m-0\">\n                        <thead>\n                            <tr class=\"bg-[#D4AF37]/10 text-[#1A202C]\">\n                                <th class=\"p-5 font-bold text-lg border-b border-[#D4AF37]/20\">Service Area</th>\n                                <th class=\"p-5 font-bold text-lg border-b border-[#D4AF37]/20 hidden md:table-cell\">Details</th>\n                                <th class=\"p-5 font-bold text-lg border-b border-[#D4AF37]/20 text-right\">Investment (INR)</th>\n                            </tr>\n                        </thead>\n                        <tbody class=\"divide-y divide-gray-100 text-gray-700 text-base\">\n                            <tr class=\"hover:bg-gray-50 transition-colors\">\n                                <td class=\"p-5 font-semibold\">Standard Maintenance</td>\n                                <td class=\"p-5 text-gray-500 hidden md:table-cell\">Filter wash, drain check, and system scan</td>\n                           