             <span class=\"px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-white/10 border border-white/20 text-white font-semibold backdrop-blur-sm\">Alkapuri</span>\n                    <span class=\"px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-white/10 border border-white/20 text-white font-semibold backdrop-blur-sm\">Makarpura GIDC</span>\n                    <span class=\"px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-white/10 border border-white/20 text-white font-semibold backdrop-blur-sm\">Sayajigunj</span>\n                    <span class=\"px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-white/10 border border-white/20 text-white font-semibold backdrop-blur-sm\">Akota</span>\n                    <span class=\"px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-white/10 border border-white/20 text-white font-semibold backdrop-blur-sm\">Karelibaug</span>\n                    <span class=\"px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-white/10 border border-white/20 text-white font-semibold backdrop-blur-sm\">Manjalpur</span>\n                    <span class=\"px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-white/10 border border-white/20 text-white font-semibold backdrop-blur-sm\">Vasna Road</span>\n                    <span class=\"px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-white/10 border border-white/20 text-white font-semibold backdrop-blur-sm\">Gotri</span>\n                    <span class=\"px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-white/10 border border-white/20 text-white font-semibold backdrop-blur-sm\">Subhanpura</span>\n                    <span class=\"px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-white/10 border border-white/20 text-white font-semibold backdrop-blur-sm\">Bhayli</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <section class=\"py-12 bg-yellow-50/80 border border-yellow-200 rounded-2xl my-8\">\n            <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 max-w-4xl\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-start space-x-6\">\n                    <div class=\"flex-shrink-0 text-yellow-500 text-4xl mt-1\">\n                        <i class=\"fas fa-info-circle\"></i>\n                    </div>\n                    <div>\n                        <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-3 mt-0\">Nominative Fair Use &amp; Affiliation</h3>\n                        <p class=\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed text-sm mb-4\">\n                            <strong>We want to be clear that Atlas Aircon is an independent, third-party repair business.</strong> We are not official representatives of, authorized by, or sponsored by the IFB brand. When we use the name &#8220;IFB&#8221; on our site, it is strictly to inform you that our local engineers are fully trained and experienced in servicing that specific brand of air conditioners.\n                        </p>\n                        <p class=\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed text-sm mb-0\">\n                            We support your right to choose who fixes your appliances. Many customers prefer independent repair shops because we can often get there much faster than brand-exclusive centers. However, please know that if your AC is still under its original manufacturer warranty, using an independent company might void that warranty. To give you total peace of mind, we provide our own 3 to 6-month warranty on any repair work we perform.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n    </div>\n\n    <footer class=\"bg-[#1A202C] text-gray-400 py-12 rounded-3xl mt-12 border-t-4 border-[#D4AF37]\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 text-center\">\n            <h3 class=\"text-white font-black text-2xl m-0 tracking-tight\">ATLAS<span class=\"text-[#D4AF37]\">AIRCON</span></h3>\n            <p class=\"text-sm mt-4 max-w-xl mx-auto\">The authority in independent IFB air conditioning repairs across Vadodara. Engineering mastery, transparent pricing, and 24/7 reliability for your home and industry.</p>\n            <div class=\"flex justify-center space-x-6 mt-8\">\n                <a href=\"tel:+919727257141\" class=\"text-[#D4AF